WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,280
Farewell failed

2
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:09,840
It is a second-level key such as fingerprint or palm print.

3
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:22,740
After losing farewell, I successfully found my hand

4
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:26,850
Why are you taking medicine?

5
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:30,330
How can you eat the food here without any problem?

6
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:31,610
Just jelly beans

7
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:32,810
How can you go out without eating?

8
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:36,200
Have you forgotten why you need to eat this before going out?

9
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:37,360
Of course it's a rule

10
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,080
You can only leave after eating this

11
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:40,910
Such an important rule

12
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:44,540
I'm such a high pill that I don't even remember that I did it for you

13
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:49,490
This is my first successful research product.

14
00:00:49,490 --> 00:00:51,010
I was supposed to hand it in tomorrow

15
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:52,290
They can eat it

16
00:00:52,570 --> 00:00:55,110
Aren't you looking for the ledger?

17
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:57,850
I saw the introduction in the archives before

18
00:00:57,970 --> 00:00:59,570
This real ledger should be found

19
00:00:59,690 --> 00:01:01,050
Maybe it will be a prop

20
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:04,300
So is this some hidden thread mission?
